cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the accompanying manuscript once it is public."
title: "parametric-closure-forests: exact algorithms for parametric maximum closure on directed forests"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Furini
    given-names: Fabio
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/fabiofurini/parametric-closure-forests"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-28"
abstract: >
  Independent C++ implementation and benchmark infrastructure for the
  parametric maximum-closure problem on directed forests: PaC, DPaC, HPaC,
  DHPaC, HIPaC, HOPaC and a rake-and-compress (RaC) algorithm, together with an
  exhaustive-enumeration oracle, reproducible instance generators and a
  benchmark/aggregation pipeline. This repository accompanies a forthcoming
  paper on the parametric closure problem; it is independent from, and does
  not depend on, the precedence-constrained knapsack (PCKP) codebase and
  arXiv paper it was ported from.
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "Parametric maximum closure on directed forests: exact algorithms and computational study"
  authors:
    - family-names: Furini
      given-names: Fabio
  status: in-preparation
